 A new kind of old classic game boy like game that you can play and enjoy for free!
 Jungle Monk is coming to stay! You control the Monk by tapping left and right, and you can also jump and attack.
 Junk Monk is a retro game very similar to the epic game boy games, but with very exciting features such as several special skills, and different weapons. Junk Monk can be downloaded for free and you can enjoy it with all its features. If you want to remove all the ads you can make a simple purchase within the game, but do it only if you like it!
 ■ Over 20 Levels, and more coming soon! You''ll play through 20 short courses one after the other, with the courses changing each time you play. You''ll find all kind of monsters on your way.
 ■ Be ready to swim Some of the levels will require you to get into the water in order to carry on, be careful, water is freezing!
 ■ Super Jumps Got stuck somewhere? Cannot reach the other side with a normal jump? watch out closely for jump propellers, they might be hidden, even underwater.
 ■ Wold Map You''ll be making progress through a wold map, going one step forward on each level, and you can always go back to play again on any of the completed levels.
 ■ Ranking Google Ranking integrated, so you can compete against your friends to see who is the boss. Hint: The quickest usually has an advantage :)
 ■ Tutorial Not sure where to begin? Check out the tutorial and get up to speed within seconds.
 ■ Support Skills Need some help? Grab a healthy potion if you are struggling or use the armor shield to be more resistent against your enemies. Trying to beat your own records? Wear on the speed shoes and run faster than ever!
